---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About GlobalsBlog — Travel, Auto, Beauty & Free Online Calculators"
	description="GlobalsBlog is an independent editorial platform publishing travel guides, auto reviews, beauty tips, news, and free online calculators for Indian readers. Learn about our mission, what we cover, and how to contact us."
>
	<section class="content-page">
		<div class="content-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">About GlobalsBlog</p>
			<h1>Practical articles and free tools for travel, auto, beauty, and news.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				GlobalsBlog is an independent editorial platform built for readers who want useful,
				easy-to-read content — and the tools to act on it. From destination guides and car reviews
				to free travel calculators, everything is organised for quick discovery in one place.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-grid">
			<article class="content-card">
				<h2>What we publish</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog covers four editorial categories and hosts a suite of free interactive
					calculators — all built with the Indian reader in mind.
				</p>
				<ul class="content-list">
					<li>
						<strong>Travel</strong> — Destination guides, budget travel tips, road trip itineraries,
						adventure activity guides, and practical travel planning advice for Indian destinations.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Auto</strong> — Car reviews, mileage comparisons, EV guides, car buying advice,
						fuel efficiency tips, and the latest auto industry news for Indian car buyers.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Beauty</strong> — Skincare routines, makeup tutorials, ingredient guides
						(niacinamide, retinol, vitamin C), and product-led tips for every skin type.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>News</strong> — Timely coverage of trending topics, technology updates, health
						and wellness stories, and current events relevant to a broad online audience.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 style="margin-top:1.5rem">Free online calculators</h2>
				<p>
					Alongside editorial content, GlobalsBlog hosts eight free interactive calculators
					designed specifically for Indian travellers and car owners:
				</p>
				<ul class="content-list">
					<li>Fuel Cost Calculator — petrol and diesel expense for any trip</li>
					<li>Road Toll Calculator — NHAI highway toll estimates with FASTag comparison</li>
					<li>EV Savings Calculator — monthly and yearly savings switching to electric</li>
					<li>Car Loan EMI Calculator — monthly EMI, total interest, and total payable</li>
					<li>Trip Cost Calculator — complete holiday expense estimator</li>
					<li>Travel Budget Planner — category-by-category trip budget with per-person breakdown</li>
					<li>Road Trip Planner — fuel, tolls, food, and accommodation for self-drive trips</li>
					<li>Train vs Flight Calculator — real cost and door-to-door time comparison</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					All calculators run entirely in the browser — no signup, no data collection, instant results.
					<a href="/tools">Browse all free calculators →</a>
				</p>

				<h2 style="margin-top:1.5rem">Our editorial approach</h2>
				<p>
					Every article on GlobalsBlog is written to be genuinely useful. We prioritise specificity
					over generality — readers get real numbers, practical examples, and clear recommendations,
					not vague advice. Auto articles include real-world mileage figures. Travel guides include
					actual cost estimates. Beauty content names ingredients and explains why they work.
				</p>
				<p>
					We do not publish clickbait headlines or low-effort listicles. Our content is reviewed
					before publication and updated when information becomes outdated.
				</p>
			</article>

			<aside>
				<div class="content-card content-card-accent" style="margin-bottom:1.2rem">
					<h2>Why GlobalsBlog exists</h2>
					<p>
						The goal is to combine editorial quality with practical utility. Most content sites
						publish articles but leave readers to figure out the numbers themselves. GlobalsBlog
						integrates free calculators alongside relevant articles so you can read, calculate,
						and decide — all in one place.
					</p>
					<p>
						The site is designed for discovery: clear category archives, strong article headings,
						and a tools hub that is easy to navigate on mobile and desktop.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="content-card" style="margin-bottom:1.2rem">
					<h2>Who reads GlobalsBlog</h2>
					<ul class="content-list">
						<li>Indian travellers planning domestic trips and holidays</li>
						<li>Car buyers researching mileage, loans, and EV options</li>
						<li>Road trip enthusiasts planning self-drive adventures</li>
						<li>Beauty enthusiasts looking for routine and ingredient advice</li>
						<li>General news readers interested in current events</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="content-card">
					<h2>Get in touch</h2>
					<p>
						For editorial questions, advertising inquiries, corrections, or general feedback:
					</p>
					<p>
						<a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a>
					</p>
					<p style="margin-top:0.75rem">
						<a href="/contact-us">Visit the contact page →</a>
					</p>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</div>

		<div class="content-card" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
			<h2>Quick links</h2>
			<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;margin-top:0.5rem">
				<a href="/tools" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Free Calculators</a>
				<a href="/category/travel" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Travel</a>
				<a href="/category/auto" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Auto</a>
				<a href="/category/beauty" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Beauty</a>
				<a href="/category/news" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">News</a>
				<a href="/privacy-policy" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Privacy Policy</a>
				<a href="/contact-us" style="padding:0.45rem 1rem;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(182,91,46,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Contact</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
